IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `aotdta-donor`

-- Australian Organ and Tissue Donation and Transplantation Authority Act 2008 (Cth), ss 5, 5A, 11, 58, 58A, 59(2) -- worked
-- cases, from the seat of the registering donor.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked against a
-- decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Life facts are from the workbench scenario au/wa/cradle-to-grave-chloe/facts.json: chloe c026 (2021-03-20), Chloe (born
-- 14 March 2003) registers on the Australian Organ Donor Register at 18; her father Graham is 50, her mother Sue 48 and her
-- brother Jake 14. The cases where Chloe has died, or is 17, are HYPOTHETICAL variations of that life, used to show what the
-- Act gives her family; the life does not say she dies then. The other cases vary one fact at a time.
--
-- Generated by scratchpad gen_australian-organ-and-tissue-donation-and-transplantation-authority-act-2008_baseline.py.
-- Expected results were written by hand from the text.

§ `fixtures`

`Chloe, 18, registering` MEANS Donor WITH
    `age` IS 18
    `has died` IS FALSE
    `has legal capacity to consent to the publication` IS TRUE
    `has traditional Aboriginal or Torres Strait Islander kinship ties` IS FALSE
    `is a member of a community that accepts other relationships as kinship ties` IS FALSE
    `is survived by an authorised family member` IS FALSE

`Chloe at 17, without capacity` MEANS Donor WITH
    `age` IS 17
    `has died` IS FALSE
    `has legal capacity to consent to the publication` IS FALSE
    `has traditional Aboriginal or Torres Strait Islander kinship ties` IS FALSE
    `is a member of a community that accepts other relationships as kinship ties` IS FALSE
    `is survived by an authorised family member` IS FALSE

`Chloe at 17, with capacity` MEANS Donor WITH
    `age` IS 17
    `has died` IS FALSE
    `has legal capacity to consent to the publication` IS TRUE
    `has traditional Aboriginal or Torres Strait Islander kinship ties` IS FALSE
    `is a member of a community that accepts other relationships as kinship ties` IS FALSE
    `is survived by an authorised family member` IS FALSE

`a donor of 15 who understands` MEANS Donor WITH
    `age` IS 15
    `has died` IS FALSE
    `has legal capacity to consent to the publication` IS TRUE
    `has traditional Aboriginal or Torres Strait Islander kinship ties` IS FALSE
    `is a member of a community that accepts other relationships as kinship ties` IS FALSE
    `is survived by an authorised family member` IS FALSE

`Chloe, having died, survived by her family` MEANS Donor WITH
    `age` IS 18
    `has died` IS TRUE
    `has legal capacity to consent to the publication` IS FALSE
    `has traditional Aboriginal or Torres Strait Islander kinship ties` IS FALSE
    `is a member of a community that accepts other relationships as kinship ties` IS FALSE
    `is survived by an authorised family member` IS TRUE

`a donor who died leaving no authorised family member` MEANS Donor WITH
    `age` IS 60
    `has died` IS TRUE
    `has legal capacity to consent to the publication` IS FALSE
    `has traditional Aboriginal or Torres Strait Islander kinship ties` IS FALSE
    `is a member of a community that accepts other relationships as kinship ties` IS FALSE
    `is survived by an authorised family member` IS FALSE

`a donor with traditional kinship ties, having died` MEANS Donor WITH
    `age` IS 40
    `has died` IS TRUE
    `has legal capacity to consent to the publication` IS FALSE
    `has traditional Aboriginal or Torres Strait Islander kinship ties` IS TRUE
    `is a member of a community that accepts other relationships as kinship ties` IS FALSE
    `is survived by an authorised family member` IS TRUE

`Graham, Chloe's father, 50` MEANS Relative WITH
    `relationship` IS `parent or legal guardian`
    `age` IS 50
    `is the last person to qualify as my partner` IS FALSE

`Sue, Chloe's mother, 48` MEANS Relative WITH
    `relationship` IS `parent or legal guardian`
    `age` IS 48
    `is the last person to qualify as my partner` IS FALSE

`Jake, Chloe's brother, 14` MEANS Relative WITH
