    `age` IS 14
    `is the last person to qualify as my partner` IS FALSE

`a former spouse` MEANS Relative WITH
    `relationship` IS `former spouse or former de facto partner`
    `age` IS 40
    `is the last person to qualify as my partner` IS FALSE

`the partner who last qualified` MEANS Relative WITH
    `relationship` IS `spouse or de facto partner`
    `age` IS 40
    `is the last person to qualify as my partner` IS TRUE

`an earlier partner who no longer is the last` MEANS Relative WITH
    `relationship` IS `spouse or de facto partner`
    `age` IS 40
    `is the last person to qualify as my partner` IS FALSE

`a close friend` MEANS Relative WITH
    `relationship` IS `friend or other person`
    `age` IS 18
    `is the last person to qualify as my partner` IS FALSE

`a kinsman under Aboriginal kinship rules` MEANS Relative WITH
    `relationship` IS `related under Aboriginal or Torres Strait Islander kinship rules`
    `age` IS 30
    `is the last person to qualify as my partner` IS FALSE

§ `s 59(2) and the Register (chloe c026: Chloe registers at 18)`

#ASSERT NOT `Is my registration made under this Act` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Is my registration made under this Act` FALSE

#ASSERT `What does this Act say my registration does` TRUE EQUALS `nothing: this Act does not mention the Register; whether it counts as consent is for State or Territory law (s 59(2))`

#ASSERT NOT `Does this Act change the consent needed to remove my organs` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Does this Act change the consent needed to remove my organs` FALSE

§ `s 11 -- may the Authority keep my registration (chloe c026)`

#ASSERT `Is keeping my registration within the Authority's functions` TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `Is keeping my registration within the Authority's functions` FALSE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Is keeping my registration within the Authority's functions` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Is keeping my registration within the Authority's functions` FALSE FALSE TRUE

§ `s 58(2) -- whose consent lets the Authority name me (chloe c026 at 18; 17 and death hypothetical)`

#ASSERT `Whose consent lets the Authority publish information identifying me` `Chloe, 18, registering` EQUALS `mine (s 58(2)(a), (ac))`
#ASSERT `Whose consent lets the Authority publish information identifying me` `Chloe at 17, without capacity` EQUALS `my parent or legal guardian's (s 58(2)(ab), (ad))`
#ASSERT `Whose consent lets the Authority publish information identifying me` `Chloe at 17, with capacity` EQUALS `mine (s 58(2)(a), (ac))`
#ASSERT `Whose consent lets the Authority publish information identifying me` `a donor of 15 who understands` EQUALS `my parent or legal guardian's (s 58(2)(ab), (ad))`
#ASSERT `Whose consent lets the Authority publish information identifying me` `Chloe, having died, survived by her family` EQUALS `any one of my authorised family members' (s 58(2)(b))`
#ASSERT `Whose consent lets the Authority publish information identifying me` `a donor who died leaving no authorised family member` EQUALS `an individual the regulations authorise (s 58(2)(c))`

§ `s 58(1A), (1), (3) -- may the Authority name me`

#ASSERT `May the Authority publish information identifying me` `Chloe, 18, registering` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `May the Authority publish information identifying me` `Chloe, 18, registering` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `May the Authority publish information identifying me` `Chloe, 18, registering` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `May the Authority publish information identifying me` `Chloe, having died, survived by her family` TRUE TRUE

§ `ss 5, 5A -- my authorised family members (chloe c026 family; Chloe's death hypothetical)`

#ASSERT `Is this person one of my authorised family members` `Graham, Chloe's father, 50` `Chloe, having died, survived by her family`
#ASSERT `Is this person one of my authorised family members` `Sue, Chloe's mother, 48` `Chloe, having died, survived by her family`
#ASSERT `Is this person one of my authorised family members` `Jake, Chloe's brother, 14` `Chloe, having died, survived by her family`
