#ASSERT NOT `Is this person one of my authorised family members` `a former spouse` `Chloe, having died, survived by her family`
#ASSERT `Is this person one of my authorised family members` `the partner who last qualified` `Chloe, having died, survived by her family`
#ASSERT NOT `Is this person one of my authorised family members` `an earlier partner who no longer is the last` `Chloe, having died, survived by her family`
#ASSERT NOT `Is this person one of my authorised family members` `a close friend` `Chloe, having died, survived by her family`
#ASSERT NOT `Is this person one of my authorised family members` `a kinsman under Aboriginal kinship rules` `Chloe, having died, survived by her family`
#ASSERT `Is this person one of my authorised family members` `a kinsman under Aboriginal kinship rules` `a donor with traditional kinship ties, having died`

